  "synopsis": {
    "zh": "嚴恭在住宅設造經堂，供給書生並親自檢校，發願逐字經眼用心。原書另述造經資助與經卷保存的感應。",
    "en": "Yan Gong established a sutra-copying hall at home, supported scribes and checked their work. The account also relates religious stories of support and the preservation of scriptures."
  },
  "witnesses": [
    {
      "work": "X1540",
